[2026-05-12T11:39:55.144Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_519","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'gh pr comment 265 --repo ProverCoderAI/docker-git --body \"$(cat <<'\"'EOF'\nUpdate from AI session.\n\nRoot causes found:\n- Upstream PR Check failed in \"'`Lint` because `jscpd` detected duplicate code after the Renovate dependency update.\n- After fixing that on the fork, fresh fork CI exposed `E2E (Login context)` timeout: the generated clone-cache refresh fetched `+refs/*:refs/*`, which pulled provider PR refs such as `refs/pull/*` for `octocat/Hello-World` and made the run unbounded.\n\nFix commits are pushed to fork branch `konard/ProverCoderAI-docker-git:renovate/all`:\n- https://github.com/konard/ProverCoderAI-docker-git/commit/6dd**********************************5d4\n- https://github.com/konard/ProverCoderAI-docker-git/commit/a41**********************************bda\n\nVerification on `a41**********************************bda`:\n- `git merge-base --is-ancestor upstream/main HEAD` => upstream/main is included.\n- Local: `bun run lint`, `bun run test`, `bun run check`, `bun run lint:effect`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:dist-deps-prune` all passed.\n- Local targeted: `bun run --cwd packages/lib vitest run tests/core/templates.test.ts` passed.\n- Local `scripts/e2e/login-context.sh` could not run because Docker is unavailable in this workspace (`docker ps` and `sudo -n docker ps` failed).\n- Fork CI Check: success https://github.com/konard/ProverCoderAI-docker-git/actions/runs/25731643529\n- Fork CI Checking Dependencies: success https://github.com/konard/ProverCoderAI-docker-git/actions/runs/25731643541\n\nBlocker: PR #265 head is still `ProverCoderAI:renovate/all` at `eff**********************************3b6`, so GitHub still shows the old failed upstream status. I attempted `git push upstream HEAD:renovate/all`, but GitHub returned `Permission to ProverCoderAI/docker-git.git denied to konard` / HTTP 403. I cannot update the upstream PR branch from this token; a maintainer needs to cherry-pick/apply the two fork commits above or grant write access to update `ProverCoderAI:renovate/all`.\n\nSOURCE: n/a\nEOF\n)\"'","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/ProverCoderAI/docker-git/pull/265#issuecomment-4430126945\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
